{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"find packages/contracts -maxdepth 5 -type f | sort | sed -n '1,240p'; rg -n \\\"vrfWrapper|VRF_WRAPPER|wrapper|sepolia|mainnet|chainId\\\" packages/contracts --glob '\"'!node_modules/**'\"' --glob '\"'!out/**'\"' --glob '\"'!cache/**'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"packages/contracts/foundry.toml\npackages/contracts/hardhat.config.ts\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/interfaces/IERC1363.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/interfaces/IERC165.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/interfaces/IERC20.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/interfaces/draft-IERC6093.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/proxy/Clones.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Bytes.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Context.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Create2.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Errors.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/LowLevelCall.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Panic.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/ReentrancyGuard.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/StorageSlot.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/utils/Strings.sol\npackages/contracts/package.json\npackages/contracts/remappings.txt\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol\npackages/contracts/src/libraries/RaffleConstants.sol\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:9: * @notice Interface for contracts using VRF randomness through the VRF V2 wrapper\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:14: * @dev and funding a VRF V2+ subscription, a user can use this wrapper to create one off requests,\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:18: * @dev the fulfillment transaction, the wrapper charges an additional premium on callback gas\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:50:   * @dev Requests randomness from the VRF V2+ wrapper.\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:92:   * @notice fulfillRandomWords handles the VRF V2 wrapper response. The consuming contract must\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:102:    address vrfWrapperAddr = address(i_vrfV2PlusWrapper);\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:103:    if (msg.sender != vrfWrapperAddr) {\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase.sol:104:      revert OnlyVRFWrapperCanFulfill(msg.sender, vrfWrapperAddr);\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/interfaces/IVRFV2PlusWrapper.sol:6:   * @return the request ID of the most recent VRF V2 request made by this wrapper. This should only\npackages/contracts/node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/vrf/dev/interfaces/IVRFV2PlusWrapper.sol:68:   * @notice Requests randomness from the VRF V2 wrapper, paying in native token.\npackages/contracts/package.json:23:    \"deploy:sepolia\": \"hardhat ignition deploy ignition/modules/RaffleFun.ts --network sepolia\",\npackages/contracts/package.json:24:    \"verify:sepolia\": \"hardhat ignition verify chain-11155111\",\npackages/contracts/hardhat.config.ts:42:      chainId: 31_337,\npackages/contracts/hardhat.config.ts:44:    sepolia: {\npackages/contracts/hardhat.config.ts:47:      chainId: 11_155_111,\npackages/contracts/hardhat.config.ts:51:    mainnet: {\npackages/contracts/hardhat.config.ts:54:      chainId: 1,\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:36:    address public immutable override vrfWrapper;\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:59:    /// @dev The quote token must report exactly six decimals; the wrapper and quote token must contain deployed code.\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:63:    /// @param vrfWrapper_ Official Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper for the target chain.\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:65:    constructor(address quoteToken_, address vrfWrapper_, address protocolTreasury_) {\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:67:        _requireContract(vrfWrapper_);\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:80:        if (protocolTreasury_ == address(this) || protocolTreasury_ == quoteToken_ || protocolTreasury_ == vrfWrapper_)\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:86:        vrfWrapper = vrfWrapper_;\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:89:        address implementation = address(new Raffle(quoteToken_, vrfWrapper_));\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:158:            params.prizeToken == address(this) || params.prizeToken == quoteToken || params.prizeToken == vrfWrapper\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:165:                || params.sponsorRecipient == vrfWrapper || params.sponsorRecipient == params.prizeToken\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:85:    /// @param fee Native-token wei actually paid to the wrapper for the request.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:99:    /// @param receivedRequestId Request ID supplied by the wrapper callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:318:    ///      value above the wrapper's actual fee is returned to the caller atomically.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:359:    /// @notice Returns the wrapper's current native direct-funding price for the configured callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:360:    /// @return fee Native-token wei currently quoted by the wrapper; the value may change before request inclusion.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:399:    /// @return gasLimit Callback gas units requested from the wrapper.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:426:    /// @notice Returns the immutable Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:427:    /// @return wrapper Wrapper contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:428:    function vrfWrapper() external view returns (IVRFV2PlusWrapper wrapper);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:112:    /// @notice Returns the immutable Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper used by every raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:113:    /// @return wrapperAddress Wrapper contract address.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:114:    function vrfWrapper() external view returns (address wrapperAddress);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:121:    /// @return gasLimit Callback gas units requested from the wrapper.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:141:    /// @dev True only while the wrapper request call is executing, so a synchronous callback cannot resolve early.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:154:    /// @param vrfWrapper_ Chainlink VRF v2.5 native direct-funding wrapper fixed for the implementation and all clones.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:155:    constructor(address quoteToken_, address vrfWrapper_)\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:157:        VRFV2PlusWrapperConsumerBase(_validatedVrfWrapper(vrfWrapper_))\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:446:    function vrfWrapper() public view override returns (IVRFV2PlusWrapper wrapper) {\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:447:        wrapper = i_vrfV2PlusWrapper;\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:607:    /// @dev Validates the wrapper before passing it to the inherited constructor initializer.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:608:    /// @param wrapper Prospective Chainlink wrapper address.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:609:    /// @return validatedWrapper The same nonzero wrapper address.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:610:    function _validatedVrfWrapper(address wrapper) private pure returns (address validatedWrapper) {\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:611:        if (wrapper == address(0)) revert ZeroAddress();\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:612:        validatedWrapper = wrapper;\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
